Z||000000||Alex4mula||05-04-2000||08:35 AM||||I was inspecting my new 3.4 and I noticed that the crank has a 3.1L label stamped. Is this normal? Do they make up the other 0.3L with the bore? Tks.||||reg||5
Z||000001||batboy||05-04-2000||09:59 AM||||Yes, the 3.1 and 3.4 use the same crank, but the 3.4 cylinders are bigger. You can't just bore a 3.1 out to the 3.4 size either, because the 3.1 block don't have enough meat.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Alex4mula||05-04-2000||10:17 AM||||Good good! Now I feel better.Just wanna be sure :-) Tks||||reg||10
